## Data

This package re-exports the following packages. Each member's own data terms apply:

- @geoalgeria/aviation: Factual public listing (ANAC); IATA codes and three supplementary airports from OurAirports (public domain)
- @geoalgeria/ferroviaire: ODbL 1.0 (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/), © OpenStreetMap contributors
- @geoalgeria/gares-routieres: Data © SOGRAL; redistributed for reference
- @geoalgeria/buses: Line data © the respective Operators; redistributed for reference. The ETUSA Line attributes derived from French Wikipedia are CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/), and the shapes, Directions, Stations and memberships derived from OpenStreetMap are ODbL 1.0 (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/), © OpenStreetMap contributors. Per-part attribution is in that package's NOTICE
